"""
lineage_dashboard.py
----------------------
Streamlit dashboard: classify every sheet - across one workpaper, or every
workbook in an entity's folder - into a FIXED Input / Process / Output
category taxonomy, then draw the real sheet-to-sheet formula flow with a
hard rule enforced:

    Input   -> Input   or Process
    Process -> Process or Output

Any real formula link that breaks this rule (Process -> Input, Output ->
anything, a link touching a sheet nobody has classified yet, etc.) is drawn
as a flagged ANOMALY edge instead of being hidden or silently allowed, and
listed in its own table underneath the diagram.

Requires:
    pip install streamlit openpyxl pandas

Usage:
    streamlit run lineage_dashboard.py
"""

